  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 802.01 Notices of Exemptions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 802.01 Notices of Exemptions. The O/O shall notify persons served by the PWS in accordance with this part whenever:\n\n(a) An exemption is granted to the PWS under RSA 485:42; or\n\n(b) A condition of an exemption granted to the PWS is violated.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 800) #9730, eff 6-30-10; ss by #10771, eff 2-1-15; ss #12675, eff 1-1-19",
